ortcuts":"首页快捷方式","Remove Turn in":"移除“提交”","Remove What-if grades":"移除“假设成绩”","Remove Message a teacher":"移除“给老师发消息”","Remove What it takes":"移除“需要多少分”","Remove Edit shortcuts":"移除“编辑快捷方式”","Add a shortcut":"添加快捷方式","Missing work":"缺交作业","Gradebook":"成绩册","The buttons under the search bar on Home. Drag to reorder; up to #.":"首页搜索栏下方的按钮。拖动以重新排序；最多 # 个。","What your browser tells you about":"浏览器会提醒你什么","Browser notifications come with Plus":"浏览器通知为 Plus 专享","New grades, assignments, due dates and messages, even with Averages closed.":"新成绩、作业、截止日期和消息，即使 Averages 已关闭。","See Plus":"查看 Plus","Browser notifications":"浏览器通知","Comes with Plus.":"Plus 专享。","Notify me about":"提醒我","Grade updates":"成绩更新","A new grade or a changed score.":"新的成绩或修改过的分数。","New assignments":"新作业","Work your teachers just posted.":"老师刚发布的作业。","Due date reminders":"截止提醒","Before something is due.":"在截止之前。","New messages from your teachers.":"老师发来的新消息。","Announcements":"公告","New posts in your course updates.":"课程动态中的新帖子。","Send a test notification":"发送测试通知","Turn on browser notifications first.":"请先打开浏览器通知。","Send":"发送","Google Drive, Canva, OneDrive and calendars":"Google Drive、Canva、OneDrive 和日历","Your classes, grades, assignments and files. Averages needs this one.":"你的课程、成绩、作业和文件。Averages 需要这一项。","Files and designs":"文件和设计","Edit and add files.":"编辑和添加文件。","Edit files and turn in designs.":"编辑文件并提交设计。","Save and add files.":"保存和添加文件。","Averages only sees the files you pick, and doesn't keep them. Work you turn in goes to Schoology. Google Drive is a trademark of Google LLC.":"Averages 只能看到你选择的文件，并且不会保存。你提交的作业会发送到 Schoology。Google Drive 是 Google LLC 的商标。","Editing":"编辑","Open Word, PowerPoint and Excel files in":"Word、PowerPoint 和 Excel 文件的打开方式","Connect Canva, Google Drive or OneDrive to edit these.":"连接 Canva、Google Drive 或 OneDrive 即可编辑。","Open Office files in":"Office 文件的打开方式","Calendar sync":"日历同步","Your due dates in Google Calendar or Apple Calendar, kept up to date.":"把你的截止日期同步到 Google 日历或 Apple 日历，并保持最新。","What we keep and where it syncs":"我们保存什么，以及在哪里同步","What we keep":"我们保存什么","Your settings, starred things and drafts are saved, so they follow you to every device.":"你的设置、收藏和草稿会被保存，在你的所有设备上都能用。","Incognito":"无痕","Nothing about you is stored on our servers. Everything stays in this browser.":"我们的服务器不保存任何关于你的信息。一切都留在这个浏览器里。","Sync across devices":"跨设备同步","Always on in Classic.":"在经典模式下始终开启。","On":"开","Only search my school":"只搜索我的学校","Add contacts finds people at your school. Turn this off to find anyone on Schoology, at any school or district.":"“添加联系人”会查找你学校的人。关闭后可查找 Schoology 上任何学校或学区的人。","Your data":"你的数据","Download your data":"下载你的数据","A copy of everything Averages stored about you. Your grades and files stay in Schoology.":"Averages 保存的关于你的所有数据的副本。你的成绩和文件保留在 Schoology 中。","Download":"下载","Delete your account":"删除你的账户","Deletes everything Averages stored about you. Schoology isn't changed.":"删除 Averages 保存的关于你的所有数据。Schoology 不会改变。","Delete":"删除","Version, shortcuts and help":"版本、快捷键和帮助","Closed beta # (":"内测版 #（","Built on this computer":"在这台电脑上构建","Build local":"本地版本","Keyboard shortcuts":"键盘快捷键","Search anything":"搜索任何内容","From any page. On Home it goes to the big search box.":"在任何页面都可用。在首页会跳到大搜索框。","Search this page":"搜索本页","Jumps to the page's own search box.":"跳到本页自己的搜索框。","Close a popup":"关闭弹出窗口","Change one to use different keys. Its old keys stop working while it's changed.":"修改一个快捷键即可使用不同的按键。修改后，原来的按键不再起作用。","Help":"帮助","Help Center":"帮助中心","How things work, step by step":"一步一步了解各功能的用法","Send feedback":"发送反馈","Found a bug or have an idea? Tell us on GitHub.":"发现了错误或有好点子？在 GitHub 上告诉我们。","Privacy Policy and Terms":"隐私政策和条款","Turn in {x}":"提交 {x}","Open {x}":"打开 {x}","More for {x}":"{x} 的更多选项","Refresh {x}":"刷新 {x}","Star {x}":"收藏 {x}","Select {x}":"选择 {x}","Remove {x}":"移除 {x}","Move {x} up":"上移 {x}","Move {x} down":"下移 {x}","{x}, Teacher":"{x}，老师","{x}, Classmate":"{x}，同学","{x} grade details":"{x} 的成绩详情","# due in {x}":"{x} 有 # 项到期","Next